$ replaces its identity on \site{rp_x5} of six markets and keeps one identity on the others (\site{rpf_x5} with the all-frozen winners). Under its selected attack at \const{0.05}, R3's mean gross efficiency is \site{rp_eff5} (lowest market \site{rp_eff5_min}) and C$^*$'s is \site{rp_effc5} (Table~\ref{tab:rep-terms}).
